<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35115" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνδειξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>indication</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνδειξιν τῷ
				λόγῳ ἐνδείκνυσθαι</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐννοεῖν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				966b
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.38.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				3.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				14.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Phas.</u>
				p.10
			</span></i> H., <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				62.23
			</span></i>, etc.; esp. in disease, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.126
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.240
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as law-term,
				<i>laying of information against</i> one who discharged public
			functions for which he was legally disqualified, <i>writ of
				indictment</i> in such a case, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				20.156
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				52.1
			</span></i> (pl.), cf. Decr.ib.<i><span class="en">
				29.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1128.35
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>demonstration, display of one's good will</i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδείκνυμι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.4
				</span></i>
			), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ εἰς Ἀλέξανδρον ἔ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.219
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>proof, demonstration</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phlp.
				<u>in Mete.</u>
				123.34
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
